      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不想被罵的話，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳就去把凶手給揪出來！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
