      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你這傢伙挺不賴的嘛！\n弄得比以前還要漂亮咧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
